      "title": "Medical Director, Washington University Complete Care Clinic",
      "description": "Department Department of Medicine Division General Internal Medicine Track Clinician Rank Commensurate w/Experience Title Medical Director, Washington University Complete Care Clinic Position Description Innovate primary care delivery Provide leadership to faculty clinic Troubleshoot clinical conflicts/problems with clinical administration Partner with clinical administrator in day-to-day clinical operations Assist in clinical faculty and nurse practitioner recruitment Teach medical students in a clinical setting Option to precept residents in continuity clinic Basic Qualifications Qualified candidate must hold certification in Internal Medicine or the equivalent training and certification with an MD, MD/PhD, DO or equivalent degree. Candidate should be at or above the Associate Professor rank. We are seeking candidates with operational and administrative leadership experience in a large, complex academic medical center or integrated health system.&nbsp; Contact Name Rachel Noon Contact Email rachel.noon@wustl.edu Contact Phone 314-362-8185 Posting Date 7/19/2023 End Date No end date EEO Statement Washington University in St. Louis is committed to the principles and practices of equal employment opportunity. It is the University’s policy to provide equal opportunity and access to persons in all job titles without regard to race, ethnicity or shared ancestry, color, national origin, citizenship (where prohibited by federal law), age, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, disability, protected veteran status, or genetic information. As a federal contractor, the university maintains affirmative action programs to implement its equal employment opportunity policy for individuals with disabilities and protected veterans, in accordance with Section 503 of the Rehabilitation Act of 1973, as amended, and the Vietnam Era Veterans’ Readjustment Assistance Act of 1974 (VEVRAA), as amended. Apply Back to List 660 S. Euclid Ave. 